{
  "version": "v1.2.0",
  "date": "2026-10-27",
  "release_url": "https://github.com/SadPull/LLM-benders-SUC/releases/tag/v1.2.0",
  "changes": [
    "Unified naming: methods SA (was A), SA+R (was N+SA; the same random interval operator as training control R), SA+L118 (was L+SA / L3+SA), SA+L24 (was LIT+SA), SA+L24r2 (was LIT1+SA); programs/L118.py, L24.py, L24r2.py (were L3.py, LIT.py, LIT1.py) with unchanged bytes and SHA256",
    "lit_* modules renamed to program_training.py, run_program_training.py, program_evaluation.py, run_program_evaluation.py; new result directories use program-training-/program-evaluation- prefixes; archived directories keep their names and are reproduced with their own snapshot/",
    "offline_pilot.py adds SA+R, SA+L24 and SA+L24r2; the two L24 programs also receive scenario_loads and scenario_probabilities; SA and SA+L118 are bit-identical to v1.1.0 A and L+SA at fixed rounds, and all five methods are bit-identical before and after the rename",
    "Closed-loop multi-round program training on rts24 (program_training.py, run_program_training.py): 3-scenario training variants, fixed-anchor 15 s probes from a 120 s SA+R run, full training feedback on every earlier program checked by closed-loop.json, validation withheld from the LLM, pre-registered stopping rule (4-10 rounds, patience 2)",
    "Program evaluation (program_evaluation.py, run_program_evaluation.py): pre-registered gates T1-T3, all controls re-run from cold starts, serial single-thread runs, independent audit",
    "paper_figures.METHOD_STYLE: one colour, line style and marker per method shared by all figures (three validated categorical slots plus a neutral grey SA baseline; SA+L24r2 hollow and SA+L24 filled blue)",
    ".gitattributes marks programs/** -text so program bytes and hashes survive checkout",
    "run_paper_pilot.load_runs orders runs by (instance, seed, ARMS) instead of by file name"
  ],
