    "training": "10 rounds (MAX_ROUNDS); round 1: both programs STATIC_INVALID (set.add); best validation mean J B_r 1.22 (round 2) -> 3.08 (round 9); control R 0.32; L24 = P9b (validation1 3.005, validation2 3.151); gate passed",
