    "T1_iteration": "ITERATION_HELPS: rts24-base SA+L24 vs SA+L24r2, 4/5 final-cost wins, median AUC difference 0.041 (median reduction 6.4%); gains are mostly convergence speed, final gaps 0.53-0.59% for both",
